WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:03,900
Jiuer, you are a good girl

2
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:05,820
If the young master is still alive

3
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:07,700
I will definitely try my best

4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,020
It's a pity that the young master accepted you

5
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:14,810
Even if the young master dies, I can still marry you.

6
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:16,930
Okay, go in and sleep.

7
00:00:17,370 --> 00:00:19,010
before tomorrow comes

8
00:00:19,570 --> 00:00:23,980
This is still our home, Grandpa Li

9
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:25,440
The hotel has arrived

10
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,680
Let me go make some food

11
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:28,340
Then go ahead

12
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:32,950
Grandpa Li, it’s time to eat

13
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:50,050
Why don't you see anyone when you eat here every day? Grandpa Li?

14
00:00:50,050 --> 00:00:54,510
Grandpa Li, what are you doing here?

15
00:00:55,260 --> 00:01:16,170
It’s good that you are here, Grandpa Li Jiu’er

16
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:18,660
when you see this letter

17
00:01:18,660 --> 00:01:20,740
I have already followed the young master

18
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:22,380
You don’t have to feel bad

19
00:01:22,820 --> 00:01:25,380
Because I already know that I have no time to spare

20
00:01:25,740 --> 00:01:27,900
This time can be regarded as the end of life

21
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:30,140
It is regarded as a happy burial among the people

22
00:01:30,140 --> 00:01:32,740
I know that I suddenly let go and left Jiuer alone

23
00:01:32,740 --> 00:01:34,580
You are a very selfish girl

24
00:01:34,580 --> 00:01:35,940
But life has an end

25
00:01:35,940 --> 00:01:37,220
There's nothing I can do

26
00:01:37,580 --> 00:01:38,740
hope i die

27
00:01:38,780 --> 00:01:40,820
Can be buried in Li's backyard

28
00:01:41,140 --> 00:01:43,020
I entered Li's house from there

29
00:01:43,020 --> 00:01:45,340
I also hope to be buried there after death.

30
00:01:54,850 --> 00:01:59,680
Don’t worry, Chengning’s wish
